        "content": "### Velocity\n\n- The ideal story (good scenario): **merged PRs up, time-to-merge down, rework flat or down**.\n- Engaged vs passive compares development with and without Copilot within the same window — the cleanest attribution available with Bitbucket.\n- **Bad scenario warning**: PR count flat/down, time-to-merge up, rework climbing while Copilot cost is being paid — spend without payoff.",
